# Config keys that decode but have no consumer outside Core/ConfigLoader/,
# counted by Scripts/check-dead-config.sh. Each line is a key that is KNOWN dead
# and deliberately still present.
#
# This list should only ever shrink. Adding a line means a tunable stopped
# controlling anything and that was accepted — which needs a reason in the
# commit message, not a quiet edit here.
#
# All three below are recorded in Docs/release-readiness.md C1.

# Superseded by the detour-ratio gate; ADR 2026-08-20 (d) — the snap radius was
# never guarding what it was said to guard.
matching.route_waypoint_radius_m

# Superseded by RecapSnapshotStations when crop-scaling landed; ADR 2026-08-31 (b).
export.keyframe_interval_frames

# Stopped applying when the duration plan was rewritten; the code says so at
# RecapDurationPlan.swift:221 and RecapComposer.swift:237. DANGEROUS: film
# duration is an open design question (HANDOFF.md) and this is the key anyone
# would reach for first.
export.total_duration_max_s
